

Supply Chain & Logistics Performance Dashboard

A supply chain analytics dashboard built in Power BI to monitor freight costs, carrier performance, route efficiency, and revenue generation across beauty product lines (Cosmetics, Haircare, Skincare). The report analyzes $288.15K in total revenue, $25.58K in logistics costs, and 13,992 total products sold.



 Dashboard Preview

[Supply Chain Dashboard Preview](dashboard.png)



 Key Highlights & Metrics
Total Revenue Generated: $288.15K
Total Logistics Costs: $25.58K
Total Units Sold: 13,992 units
Key Insights Analyzed
Product Line Slicer: Interactive filter allowing instant analysis across Cosmetics, Haircare, and Skincare.
Transportation Modes: Freight cost and revenue evaluation across Rail,Road, Air, and Sea.
Carrier Performance: Shipping cost comparison across logistics providers (Carrier A, Carrier B, Carrier C).
Route & Supplier Metrics: Cost distribution across supply routes alongside supplier revenue contributions.



Tools Used
Power BI Desktop (Treemaps, Funnel Charts, Donut Charts, Dynamic Slicers)



